    "detailed_description": "It's a sokoban game, but it's not limited to Sokobans. Specifically, it's an adventure puzzle game based on a sokoban mechanic.<br>There are various traps to prevent you from getting more gems, but rest assured, there are no monsters for you to fight.<br>All you have to do is push something, get the gem or go further.<br><br><br><strong> Game story </strong><br><br>A ship falls to a strange planet during an interplanetary voyage, and no one survives except the captain.<br>The technology of the alien planet is far superior to the technology of the ship, but the captain has the ability to go back in time for a short time, and any danger is not a question.<br>The captain, faced with a damaged ship, must find a way to repair it on the planet and escape the planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.webm?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.mp4?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> Game features </strong><br><u> Rich game content </u> : More than 30 game mechanics to make the sokoban more interesting. More than 60 level puzzles to explore and collect more exciting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/51a3e41f779ffa457a82f69a1b81de70.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/51a3e41f779ffa457a82f69a1b81de70.webm?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/51a3e41f779ffa457a82f69a1b81de70.mp4?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/cfbc9ec1c8827754a6e812de7252ab1c.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/cfbc9ec1c8827754a6e812de7252ab1c.webm?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/cfbc9ec1c8827754a6e812de7252ab1c.mp4?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u> Simple operation </u> : operation is limited to directional movement, one hand can play; No instant operation, no need to fight hand speed. Hints are also given for new mechanisms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/ace696d3c9a08f98586e5c9761420c71.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/ace696d3c9a08f98586e5c9761420c71.webm?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/ace696d3c9a08f98586e5c9761420c71.mp4?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u> Character growth </u> : A character can gain key items to improve certain abilities or discover hidden items<br><u> Fast movement </u> : There is no correlation between levels, focusing on single-level puzzles. Characters can quickly return to a level they have already explored by choosing from it.<br><u> Nostalgia music </u> : Quiet retro 8bit music, let people return to the era of pixel games.",
    "about_the_game": "It's a sokoban game, but it's not limited to Sokobans. Specifically, it's an adventure puzzle game based on a sokoban mechanic.<br>There are various traps to prevent you from getting more gems, but rest assured, there are no monsters for you to fight.<br>All you have to do is push something, get the gem or go further.<br><br><br><strong> Game story </strong><br><br>A ship falls to a strange planet during an interplanetary voyage, and no one survives except the captain.<br>The technology of the alien planet is far superior to the technology of the ship, but the captain has the ability to go back in time for a short time, and any danger is not a question.<br>The captain, faced with a damaged ship, must find a way to repair it on the planet and escape the planet.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.webm?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/439cdd2ed1d6a199b3dec9711624c64f.mp4?t=1719453995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> Game features </strong><br><u> Rich game content </u> : More than 30 game mechanics to make the sokoban more interesting. More than 60 level puzzles to explore and collect more exciting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/51a3e41f779ffa457a82f69a1b81de70.poster.avif?t=1719453995\" width=640 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667590/extras/51a3e41f779ffa457a82f69a1b81d